@startuml 08c_seq_review
' Sequence diagram 3 — Review and publish a submission (v0.3, 2026-10-30)
!include _seq.iuml
title 3 · Review and publish a submission

actor "Reviewer\n(MOTIVAȚIE)" as R
participant "Review dashboard\n(Next.js pages)" as Dash
box "Backend · Next.js on Cloudflare" #FAFAFA
  participant "Domain services\n+ requireRole()" as Svc
  participant "Rules scoring" as Score
  database "D1" as DB
end box
participant "R2\n(photos)" as R2
participant "Email\nprovider" as Mail

== Open the queue ==
R -> Dash : open review queue
Dash -> Svc : list pending submissions
Svc -> Svc : requireRole(reviewer)
Svc -> DB : PENDING, oldest first
DB --> Svc : rows
Svc --> Dash : queue
Dash --> R : list with suggested levels

== Open one submission ==
R -> Dash : open submission
Dash -> Svc : claim(id)
Svc -> DB : lock to this reviewer\n(if nobody else has it)
alt already claimed by someone else
  DB --> Svc : locked
  Svc --> Dash : "being reviewed by …"
else claimed
  Svc -> DB : answers, suggestion + notes,\ncurrent assessment (if update)
  DB --> Svc : rows
  Svc --> Dash : submission + signed photo links
  Dash -> R2 : load photos
  R2 --> Dash : photos
  Dash --> R : answers and photos side by side,\nsuggestion, current vs proposed
end

opt reviewer corrects an answer
  R -> Dash : e.g. door width 8 → 80 cm
  Dash -> Svc : preview(corrections)
  Svc -> Score : recompute
  Score --> Svc : new suggested level
  Svc --> Dash : updated suggestion
end

== Decide ==
alt Approve
  R -> Dash : approve
  Dash -> Svc : approve(id, corrections)
  Svc -> Svc : merge with unchanged criteria\nof the current assessment,\ncheck publishing rule
  Svc -> DB : one batch:\nold assessment → history,\nnew one → CURRENT,\nplace level + last verified = now,\nsubmission APPROVED, change log
  DB --> Svc : ok
  Svc --> Dash : published / saved
  Dash --> R : done, next in queue
else Reject (reason required)
  R -> Dash : reject + reason
  Dash -> Svc : reject(id, reason)
  Svc -> DB : one batch: submission REJECTED\n+ reason, change log\n(verified data untouched)
  DB --> Svc : ok
  Svc --> Dash : rejected
end

Svc ->> Mail : after the response:\ndecision email to the contributor

note over Svc, DB
  <b>Publishing rule</b>
  Inaccessible: shown once the entry path is known.
  Accessible / partially accessible: shown once all
  6 mandatory criteria are known. Until then the
  approved answers are saved, but the place stays
  "Not yet rated" in the app.
end note
note over R2 : Photos of rejected submissions\nare deleted after 6 months\n(Cleanup job).
@enduml
